{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Teddy's Haven - A Fantasy Inspired Shop Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3615160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An enchanted shop sim at the edge of a magical world.</i><br><i>Created In Loving Dedication To The Memory Of My Best Friend Teddy Bear.  </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy\u2019s Haven</strong> is a cozy fantasy shop simulator where you run a small, magical store nestled on the outskirts of a mysterious island. Specializing in potions, weapons, and enchanted curios, your humble haven draws in adventurers, wandering mages, and mystical creatures\u2014each seeking something special beneath your warm, glowing lights.<br><br><strong>Discover the Isle of Ursa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shop rests at the edge of <strong>Ursa</strong>, a magical island filled with ancient forests, glimmering lakes, and forgotten wonders. The land itself is imbued with quiet magic, responding to your care and growing alongside you as your shop flourishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you nurture your haven, the island\u2019s secrets begin to reveal themselves, with each change you make encouraging the land to unfold new mysteries. Your presence is felt here\u2014this shop is not just a place of business, but a part of the very soul of Ursa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Dream Shop</strong>: Run your own cozy store, from stocking shelves to hiring magical employees and customizing every aspect of your shop's design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; World Events</strong>: Venture into a rich, vibrant world full of surprises. Engage with dynamic seasonal and daily events that keep the world feeling alive and ever-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Systems</strong>: Unlock a variety of skills like <strong>stocking</strong>, <strong>harvesting</strong>, <strong>tending animals</strong>, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+</strong>: For those who want to restart and experience the game from a fresh perspective, the <strong>New Game+</strong> system allows you to carry over your progress while experiencing the early changes in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounds Breaking Joy:</strong> Teddy\u2019s Haven celebrates curiosity. And sometimes that means climbing too high, falling too far, or finding yourself under the map. Go ahead: break the bounds. Secret items and small surprises await those who wander a little too far from the intended path. It\u2019s all part of the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing Development</strong>: <i>Teddy\u2019s Haven</i> is in Early Access, with plans for <strong>new locations</strong>, <strong>minigames</strong>, <strong>world events</strong>, and more, the journey has only just begun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Early Access?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, I\u2019ve poured my heart into creating a world that feels magical and alive. Your support helps me grow the game and continue working on new content for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Teddy\u2019s Haven Discord</strong> to share your feedback, report bugs, and help shape the future of this cozy adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An enchanted shop sim at the edge of a magical world.</i><br><i>Created In Loving Dedication To The Memory Of My Best Friend Teddy Bear.  </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy\u2019s Haven</strong> is a cozy fantasy shop simulator where you run a small, magical store nestled on the outskirts of a mysterious island. Specializing in potions, weapons, and enchanted curios, your humble haven draws in adventurers, wandering mages, and mystical creatures\u2014each seeking something special beneath your warm, glowing lights.<br><br><strong>Discover the Isle of Ursa</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shop rests at the edge of <strong>Ursa</strong>, a magical island filled with ancient forests, glimmering lakes, and forgotten wonders. The land itself is imbued with quiet magic, responding to your care and growing alongside you as your shop flourishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you nurture your haven, the island\u2019s secrets begin to reveal themselves, with each change you make encouraging the land to unfold new mysteries. Your presence is felt here\u2014this shop is not just a place of business, but a part of the very soul of Ursa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Dream Shop</strong>: Run your own cozy store, from stocking shelves to hiring magical employees and customizing every aspect of your shop's design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; World Events</strong>: Venture into a rich, vibrant world full of surprises. Engage with dynamic seasonal and daily events that keep the world feeling alive and ever-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Systems</strong>: Unlock a variety of skills like <strong>stocking</strong>, <strong>harvesting</strong>, <strong>tending animals</strong>, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+</strong>: For those who want to restart and experience the game from a fresh perspective, the <strong>New Game+</strong> system allows you to carry over your progress while experiencing the early changes in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounds Breaking Joy:</strong> Teddy\u2019s Haven celebrates curiosity. And sometimes that means climbing too high, falling too far, or finding yourself under the map. Go ahead: break the bounds. Secret items and small surprises await those who wander a little too far from the intended path. It\u2019s all part of the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ongoing Development</strong>: <i>Teddy\u2019s Haven</i> is in Early Access, with plans for <strong>new locations</strong>, <strong>minigames</strong>, <strong>world events</strong>, and more, the journey has only just begun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Early Access?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, I\u2019ve poured my heart into creating a world that feels magical and alive. Your support helps me grow the game and continue working on new content for years to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Teddy\u2019s Haven Discord</strong> to share your feedback, report bugs, and help shape the future of this cozy adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Teddy\u2019s Haven is a cozy shop simulator where you manage a magical store, explore a whimsical world, and master skills like Stocking and Harvesting. Enjoy shop customization, dynamic events, and a New Game+ system. Join Early Access to help shape the game\u2019s future!",
